/span> Apply to the <a {{1}}>PhET for Schools Network</a> to receive up to 20 teacher seats for PhET Studio at no cost for the 2025-26 school year. Limited spots available!","phetStudioOverview.pricing.curriculumLicense":"Curriculum License","phetStudioOverview.pricing.idealForCurriculumTeams":"Ideal for curriculum teams, districts, and other educational systems interested in providing uniform learning experiences for multiple classrooms.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.editorsCanCreateInCurriculum":"Editors can create presets to use in curriculum maps or shared lessons.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.presetUseIsLimitedSystem":"Preset use is limited to the system’s classrooms.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.cost5000":"Cost: Starts at $5,000/year.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.contactPhetPartnershipsToGetStarted":"Contact <a {{0}}>phet-partnerships@colorado.edu</a> to get started.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.commercialLicense":"Commercial License","phetStudioOverview.pricing.idealForCommercialEntities":"Ideal for non-profit or for-profit commercial entities interested in crafting unique learning experiences for their users.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.editorsCanCreateForProducts":"Editors can create presets to use in their products.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.includesUniquePresetFeatures":"Includes unique preset features exclusive to commercial licenses.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.costCustomPricing":"Cost: Custom pricing.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.favoriteNonprofitStemResource":"PhET Studio allows you to support your favorite nonprofit STEM resource. As a nonprofit organization, we rely on grants and donations to create and maintain our simulations.","phetStudioOverview.pricing.directlyFundNewResources":"PhET Studio gives users the opportunity to directly fund new resources in PhET, helping our project stay sustainable for decades to come."}}},"PhetStudioGirlCalloutPanel.tsx":function(e,t,n){let i,o;n.export({PhetStudioGirlCalloutPanel:()=>r},!0),n.link("react",{def