nsing Information"),i.createElement(m,null,i.createElement("b",null,"“PhET Interoperable HTML Simulation File”")," means an individual minified HTML simulation file where PhET HTML Simulation Source Code assets, PhET HTML Common Source Code assets, and PhET Interoperable HTML Source Code (PhET Interoperable HTML Source Code is defined below) assets are combined into a single, minified HTML file. PhET Interoperable HTML Simulation Files provide additional capabilities not included in PhET Regular HTML Simulation Files. Additional capabilities include, by way of example, an application programming interface (API) or back-end data capabilities."),i.createElement(m,null,"PhET Interoperable HTML Simulation Files are licensed through individual agreements. ANY USE OF PHET INTEROPERABLE HTML SIMULATION FILES IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED WITHOUT A LICENSE. Please contact ",i.createElement("a",{className:"inline-link",href:"mailto:phethelp@colorado.edu"},"phethelp@colorado.edu")," to inquire about licensing.")),i.createElement("section",{className:"minor-section"},i.createElement(u,null,"C. ‘PhET HTML Simulation Source Code’: GNU General Public License Version 3"),i.createElement(m,null,i.createElement("b",null,"“PhET HTML Simulation Source Code”")," is the collection of original simulation specific assets used by a PhET simulation, including but not limited to source code (JavaScript/HTML/CSS), images, audio and text."),i.createElement(m,null,"PhET licenses PhET HTML Simulation Source Code under the ",i.createElement("a",d({className:"inline-link",href:"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html"},a),"GNU General Public License Version 3")," (",i.createElement("b",null,"“GPLv3”"),"). The full text of the GPLv3 is available here: ",i.createElement("a",d({className:"inline-link",href:"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html"},a),"https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html"),"."),i.createElement(m,null,"The simulation-specific PhET HTML Simulation Source Code repositories can be accessed at ",i